  ExtTable grids.** `gui/templates/search/searchAdvancedView.html` `renderTC()`/`renderRQ()`
  now route through a new `renderGrouped()` (`:544`, `:507`, `:627`): Test Case results are
  grouped per test-suite `path`, Requirements per requirement-spec `path`, each group under a
  collapsible header `Test Suite: Suite Alpha (2 Items)` / `Requirement Specification: Spec A
  (Smoke) (1 Item)` — legacy `buildTCExtTable()` `setGroupByColumnName(test_suite)`
