  (`:402`), GroupingView `showGroupName` + `groupTextTpl` counts
  (`lib/functions/exttable.class.php:589-591`). Clicking a group header collapses/expands only
  that group; a per-section grid toolbar restores the legacy
  `Ext.ux.TableToolbar` (`gui/javascript/ext_extensions.js:184`): **Expand/collapse groups**
  (`expandCollapseAll`) and **Reset filters** (`resetFilters` — default view, all expanded).
  TS/RS sections stay flat (legacy does not group them). No BFF change was needed — the
  `fulltext` payload already carries `path` per TC/RQ row (`api/search/index.php:584,:623`).
  i18n `searchAdv.expandCollapseGroups|resetFilters|groupHeader|groupItem|groupItems|ungrouped`
  in all 10 bundles (coverage gate PASS 9/9). Verified in browser on fixture `tmp/fixtures_1098.php`
  (project SA1098): 4 TC rows → 2 groups (2 Items each), 2 RQ rows → 1 group each; single-group
  toggle, expand/collapse-all, reset-proof; `node --check` clean; console 0 errors; Event Viewer
  no Error/Warning; test suite "Task — Issue #1098" PASS. (Refs #1098)

