- [KEY BUGFIX] - #1536: legacy deep-link controllers reqSpecView.php + archiveData.php no longer emit E_WARNING-on-view. Both are now clean 302 redirect stubs to their modern twins (gui/templates/requirements/reqSpecView.html, gui/templates/testcases/tcEdit.html), preserving req_spec_id/tcase_id/tproject_id/tplan_id deep-links. The redirect target is root-relative (/gui/templates/...) so a deep link resolves to the modern screen (HTTP 200), not to a relative-path 404. 7x E_WARNING class removed from legacy dashio deep-link views. (Refs #1536)
