### Gap closed — Assign Test Project Roles: the role column header was static and never named the test project (Fixes #1612)
- `gui/templates/usermanagement/usersAssignProject.html:106` rendered a static
  `<th data-i18n="assign.assignedRole">Assigned Role</th>`. Legacy
