  context selectors (test project / plan / build / platform), target selector
  (single test case / test suite / whole test project, incl. the legacy
  recursive suite subtree), resolved automation-server badge per node, the
  `check_test_automation_server` hint, and a per-test-case result table with
  status/result/notes plus answered / not-passed / config-problem /
  connection-failure counters and the 200-case truncation notice.
  All 53 screen strings localized in the 10 client-side locale bundles.
