  `Undefined array key` warning (Event Viewer entry) when the remote XML-RPC
  server answers a non-conformant `result` code; the code is kept verbatim.
- Result codes returned by the remote server are now resolved through
  `results.code_status` / `results.status_code`, so `answered` and
  `not passed` counters are correct and a non conformant code is rendered
  verbatim instead of being counted as a pass.
