  descends into the `testcase_step` children of a test case, so it stops
  emitting one `Undefined array key "testcase_step"` warning per test case
  (core issue #1589).
- Hardening after the code review: the XML-RPC client gets an explicit 20s
  timeout (a hung automation server no longer blocks the request), the
  plan / build / platform of the forwarded context are validated against the
  authorised project, a non-array or `result`-less XML-RPC answer is reported
  as a config problem instead of reading an array offset on a non-array, the
  two missing result-status labels (`not available`, `all`) are localized in
  the 10 bundles, and the "Open test case" fallback points at the existing
  `search/searchView.html`.

